B.bJX=s(["Modpas inisyal","Mot de passe initial","Initial password"],t.s)
B.bIl=s(["Pwopriyet\xe8 a ka kreye manadj\xe8 ak resepsyon s\xe8lman. S\xe8v\xe8 a verifye w\xf2l, sal la ak chak repriz demann.","Le propri\xe9taire peut cr\xe9er uniquement des responsables et r\xe9ceptionnistes. Le serveur v\xe9rifie le r\xf4le, la salle et chaque reprise.","The owner can create managers and reception staff only. The server verifies the role, gym and every retry."],t.s)
B.bMQ=s(["Chanje aks\xe8 a","Modifier l\u2019acc\xe8s","Change access"],t.s)
